<title>USA: US Stockpile sells 380 tonnes tin at $2.7475/lb.</title>
<headline>US Stockpile sells 380 tonnes tin at $2.7475/lb.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense Logistics Agency said it sold 380 tonnes of stockpile tin at its daily offering Friday to two firms at a unit price of $2.7475 per lb.</p>
<p>The DLA sold 200 tonnes of tin to RMT Metals of New York, N.Y. and 180 tonnes to American Iron and Metal of Montreal, Canada.</p>
